OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather grey and damp start
OL,6,Fwith some further outbreaks of rain.
OL,7,FTurning drier into the afternoon with
OL,8,Fsome brightness developing and chance
OL,9,Fof some isolated showers. Winds
OL,10,Fcontinuing to ease and feeling warm.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with some patchy light
OL,13,Fran over higher ground at first, then
OL,14,Fskies clearing overnight and becoming
OL,15,Fmore settled. Winds becoming light but
OL,16,Fbreezy along the coast.
OL,17,
OL,18,CFriday:FClear skies to start becoming
OL,19,Fcloudy with sunny spells feeling
OL,20,Fwarmer than of late. Winds remaining
OL,21,Flight but breezy along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
