OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FLargely
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells on Saturday. In
OL,7,Fthe sunshine it will be feeling
OL,8,Fincreasingly warm, before a risk of
OL,9,Fsome rain returns by Sunday and into
OL,10,FMonday.
